-- Imports the prelude and calls nothing in it, with a decision for the DMN
-- export and a regulative rule for the BPMN export. Exported against a copy of
-- the libraries whose `prelude.l4` is not the compiled-in copy, the DMN report
-- carries an Advisory D-NOT-LIBRARY note and the BPMN report does not.
IMPORT prelude

DECLARE Party IS ONE OF Payer
DECLARE Act IS ONE OF `pay`

GIVEN x IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `doubled` x IS x TIMES 2

`the payment` MEANS
  PARTY Payer
  MUST `pay`
  WITHIN 30
